    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Review the individual business document analyses provided below and create ONE concise management summary for Northstar Office Supplies Ltd.\n\nDo not analyze the original documents again.\nUse only the information contained in the individual analyses.\nDo not invent or guess information.\n\nYour summary must contain exactly these four sections:\n\nNumber of Documents:\nState the total number of documents analyzed.\n\nTypes of Documents:\nList the different types of documents identified. If multiple documents have the same type, do not unnecessarily repeat the type.\n\nBrief Summary:\nProvide a concise overall summary of what the documents are about and the most important business points for Northstar Office Supplies Ltd.\n\nThose That Need Human Attention:\nList only documents or issues that require human review, a decision, an action, or attention due to deadlines, renewals, financial commitments, contractual concerns, risks, or other important matters.\nIf nothing requires human attention, write \"None identified.\"\n\nINDIVIDUAL DOCUMENT ANALYSES:\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.documents) }}",
